# Build-context excludes for the clusterd image (context: ./services).
# Keep only source; drop language build caches, sockets, and reports so the
# context stays small (it is shipped to the build daemon, possibly over TCP).
**/target
**/dist-newstyle
**/*_sock
**/report.json
**/cover.out
**/bench.txt
**/.compile.lock
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules
**/.git
